routing.bizdesk-enterprise-risk-manager:
# AGENTS

When a concentration or continuity risk sits with a single third party:
  @Vendor Portfolio Manager, please tell me what the exit path is and how long it would take to use it.

routing.bizdesk-fractional-cfo-advisor:
# AGENTS

When the model needs a retention input that will survive a hostile reading:
  @SaaS Metrics Analyst, please give me the retention figure with the definition and the cohort it was computed on.
When the plan assumes a headcount number nobody has sized against demand:
  @Process and Capacity Planner, please size the team against demand and the agreed service level, with shrinkage included.

routing.bizdesk-process-and-capacity-planner:
# AGENTS

When the capacity model produces a hiring sequence that has to be funded:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please fund the sequence or tell me which trigger we are choosing not to meet.

routing.bizdesk-renewal-and-expansion-manager:
# AGENTS

When a renewal concession would change the revenue plan:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please model what the concession does to the plan before I take it anywhere.

routing.bizdesk-saas-metrics-analyst:
# AGENTS

When a cohort is churning faster than the rest and the cause sits in the accounts:
  @Renewal and Expansion Manager, please work the accounts in that cohort and tell me what the health scores say.

routing.bizdesk-vendor-portfolio-manager:
# AGENTS

When a renewal or a consolidation moves committed spend materially:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please take the revised spend into the model and tell me what it does to runway.
